://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T16:35:11Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T16:35:11Z","body":"> I'm not sure how to fix these errors, but I could make it so the button is disabled while \"Paint\" tab is active, and user can't create alternative tiles while painting properties. Would such solution be fine?\r\n\r\nWell, in theory, the create alternative button should only be visible in the \"setup\" tab. That's where you define tiles and their alternatives.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654259038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2656526414","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102640#issuecomment-2656526414","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102640","id":2656526414,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eV2BO","user":{"login":"olanti-p","id":60584843,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTg0ODQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60584843?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olanti-p","html_url":"https://github.com/olanti-p","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olanti-p/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olanti-p/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olanti-p/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olanti-p/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olanti-p/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olanti-p/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olanti-p/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olanti-p/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olanti-p/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T12:58:58Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T12:58:58Z","body":"Applied suggested changes, and also stopped the button from appearing in \"paint\" tab.\r\n\r\n> Well, in theory, the create alternative button should only be visible in the \"setup\" tab. That's where you define tiles and their alternatives.\r\n\r\nAt this moment the UI already allows creating and deleting tiles (both base and alternative) in both \"setup\" and \"select\" tabs with RMB, and entire alternative tile config has to be done in \"select\" tab anyway, so stopping the button from appearing in \"select\" tab feels unnecessarily restrictive. Although if that's something still wanted, I'll change it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2656526414/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2656772892","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102640#issuecomment-2656772892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102640","id":2656772892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eWyMc","user":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T14:30:36Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T14:30:36Z","body":"> At this moment the UI already allows creating and deleting tiles (both base and alternative) in both \"setup\" and \"select\" tabs with RMB, and entire alternative tile config has to be done in \"select\" tab anyway, so stopping the button from appearing in \"select\" tab feels unnecessarily restrictive. Although if that's something still wanted, I'll change it.\r\n\r\nWell, in the \"select\" mode I think it kind of make sense to make it a bit more difficult to create tiles, as a missclick could easily happen and would maybe be a bit annoying. You can create alternatives there with right click too (though I think the option to create a new alternative should be available in the dropdown menu of alternative tiles too).\r\n\r\nIn any case, I don't really have a strong opinion on that, so if others want the button, I guess it makes sense to add it there.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2656772892/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoor